p://www.wikidot.com/user:info/meowait" >Meowait</a></span></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-XXXxxxxxxx">权限不足</a></td> <td><strong>权限不足</strong></td> <td>权限不足</td> </tr> </table> <p><br /> <br /> <br /></p> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>相关故事</span></h2> </div> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <blockquote> <h2><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/pay">愚蠢的交易</a></span></h2> <p><em>这是一次对你的馈赠，即使你也明白它最终会化作泡影</em><br /> &#8212; by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/severity" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4182653&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606269325" alt="Severity" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4182653)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/severity" >Severity</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <h2><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/live-on">暮朝</a></span></h2> <p><em>当过去不再，未来将临</em><br /> &#8212; by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/severity" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4182653&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606269325" alt="Severity" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4182653)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/severity" >Severity</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <h2><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/flowers-ocean">花海</a></span></h2> <p><em>彼岸花会从冥界生长，直到人间变成炼狱</em><br /> &#8212; by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/severity" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4182653&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606269325" alt="Severity" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4182653)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/severity" >Severity</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <h2><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/fcc">幻影中的翡翠之城</a></span></h2> <p><em>我不知梦何时开始，也不知它何时结束</em><br /> &#8212; by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drekelhaft" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4150196&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606269325" alt="DrEkelhaft" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4150196)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drekelhaft" >DrEkelhaft</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <h2><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/snow-white">雪白</a></span></h2> <p><em><strong>没有人</strong>逝去了，没有人再在这里呼吸，呼吸。</em><br /> &#8212; by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-obsidian-shard" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5090298&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606269325" alt="The Obsidian Shard" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5090298)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-obsidian-shard" >The Obsidian Shard</a></span></p> </blockquote> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-4" style="display:none"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <hr /> <h2><span>加入我们</span></h2> <hr /></div> <br /> <p>众所周知，在SCP基金会当一名研究员或外勤特工是一份极度危险的工作，每天与无数危险的项目共处使工作人员置身于危险的境地。站点工作人员都已经习惯了每天目睹袋子里的尸体&#8230;&#8230;或者说尸块？</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">但是这不更好吗？</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">这意味着Site-CN-02永远提供新的工作岗位！</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"></div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;如果你想支持基金会的工作......</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">这就对了！</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <blockquote> <p>这里是Site-CN-02的主要交流QQ群，在这里，你可以畅所欲言！<br /> 你可以随意分享你最热爱的SCP项目！<br /> 也可以随意讨论博士们的花边绯闻！<br /> <strong>824475183</strong><br /> 欢迎你的加入！</p> </blockquote> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <br /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;如果你想收容一个项目，拯救人类于水火之中.......</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">这就对了！</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <blockquote> <p>撰写一份SCP文档，收容极其危险的高危项目！<br /> 是不是很酷！<br /> 站点负责人员会指引你加入站点！<br /> 欢迎加入<a href="https://jq.qq.com/?_wv=1027&amp;k=5Q7LQhH">Site-CN-02 文书部门</a>！<br /> <em>请确保你读过<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/guide-for-newbies">新手指南</a></em></p> </blockquote> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lillian-griffin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3761458&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606269325" alt="Lillian Griffin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3761458)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lillian-griffin" >Lillian Griffin</a></span></p> 
